# KUPOL

You are working in this repo (github.com/rustoman-AI/kupol).

## Product
- Name: KUPOL
- Domain: https://kupol.app
- Public CLI: kupol
- Not affiliated with GitLab. Not GitLab Duo.

## Hard rules
- Do not rename the Cargo package or binary target (keep crate name `duo-agents` so `cargo build` still works).
- Do not rewrite the Rust scanner unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not commit `duo-agents` binaries or `*.tar.gz`. Keep them in `.gitignore` and GitHub Releases only.
- Do not invent features. `duo-kan/` is public in this repo — do not call it closed-core.
- Do not mention GitLabHQ vulns, KAN miracles, or auto-healing MRs on the site or README.
- Forbidden strings in product-facing files (README, website, AGENTS.md, docs meant for users): "GitLab Duo", "Duo Agent Platform", "Duo Architecture Guardian", "Duo Chat".
- GitLab is OK only as an optional git/CI host, same as GitHub.

## Public CLI
`kupol` wraps the engine (`$KUPOL_BIN`, `duo-agents` on PATH, `./target/release/duo-agents`, or `./release_build/duo-agents`).
Commands: scan, serve, init, mcp, info, demo, help.
`kupol scan [path] [-f table|json|markdown] [-o file]`
